{"text":"Want a master's without pausing your career?\nHere's the Saint Mary's University of Minnesota Master of Arts in Education, delivered in Kuwait.\nSpecialised in Curriculum and Instruction.\nThirty credits. Ten courses. Eighteen months.\nClasses meet in person every week, designed for working educators.\nYou pay monthly, not in one lump sum.\nAnd it's a US degree, from a university accredited by the Higher Learning Commission.\nKeep teaching. Keep growing.\nThe next cohort starts in January.","display":"Want a master's without pausing your career?\nHere's the Saint Mary's University of Minnesota Master of Arts in Education, delivered in Kuwait.\nSpecialised in Curriculum and Instruction.\nThirty credits. Ten courses. Eighteen months.\nClasses meet in person every week, designed for working educators.\nYou pay monthly, not in one lump sum.\nAnd it's a US degree, from a university accredited by the Higher Learning Commission.\nKeep teaching. Keep growing.\nThe next cohort starts in January.","voice":"eric","model":"eleven_v4_turbo","chars":486,"duration":31.477551,"words":[{"w":"Want","s":0,"e":0.21,"d":"Want"},{"w":"a","s":0.24,"e":0.28,"d":"a"},{"w":"master's","s":0.32,"e":0.88,"d":"master's"},{"w":"without","s":1.04,"e":1.2,"d":"without"},{"w":"pausing","s":1.28,"e":1.6,"d":"pausing"},{"w":"your","s":1.68,"e":1.76,"d":"your"},{"w":"career?","s":1.84,"e":2.24,"d":"career?"},{"w":"Here's","s":2.72,"e":2.96,"d":"Here's"},{"w":"the","s":3.04,"e":3.12,"d":"the"},{"w":"Saint","s":3.2,"e":3.36,"d":"Saint"},{"w":"Mary's","s":3.44,"e":3.76,"d":"Mary's"},{"w":"University","s":3.84,"e":4.32,"d":"University"},{"w":"of","s":4.4,"e":4.44,"d":"of"},{"w":"Minnesota","s":4.48,"e":5.04,"d":"Minnesota"},{"w":"Master","s":5.2,"e":5.52,"d":"Master"},{"w":"of","s":5.6,"e":5.68,"d":"of"},{"w":"Arts","s":5.76,"e":5.92,"d":"Arts"},{"w":"in","s":6,"e":6.04,"d":"in"},{"w":"Education,","s":6.08,"e":6.96,"d":"Education,"},{"w":"delivered","s":7.04,"e":7.36,"d":"delivered"},{"w":"in","s"